{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TypeA","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwBasisField"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.basisTwOfSn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.basisTwOfSn","kind":"def","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L251-L255","doc":"**The `T_w` basis, transported.** Indexed by `Equiv.Perm (Fin (n+1))`, as on the\nsibling side. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.finrank_IwahoriHeckeOfSn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.finrank_IwahoriHeckeOfSn","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L244-L249","doc":"**`dim_K H_n(q) = (n+1)!` for the `HeckeAlgebra`-backed presentation**, transported\nacross `algEquiv` from `QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.finrank_eq_factorial`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.algEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.algEquiv","kind":"def","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L219-L231","doc":"**The two presentations are the same algebra.**\n\nThis is what transports `QOU/Hecke/TwBasisField.lean`'s `finrank_eq_factorial` — proved\nagainst their presentation, and explicitly *not* claimed for mine by its author — onto\n`IwahoriHeckeOfSn`. An `AlgEquiv` carries a basis and a finrank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.theirs_hom_ext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.theirs_hom_ext","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L203-L216","doc":"Two algebra maps out of *their* presentation agreeing on generators are equal —\nthe same `mkAlgHom`-surjective plus `FreeAlgebra.hom_ext` argument as on my side. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toMine_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toMine_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L196-L200","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toMine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toMine","kind":"def","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L181-L193","doc":"**The canonical algebra map back**, generator to generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_commute","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L169-L176","doc":"My `σ` satisfies their far-commutation relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_braid","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L154-L167","doc":"My `σ` satisfies their braid relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_quadratic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.my_sigma_quadratic","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L134-L152","doc":"My `σ` in their quadratic shape `σ² = (q−1)·σ + q·1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toTheirs_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toTheirs_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L128-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toTheirs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.toTheirs","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L122-L125","doc":"**The canonical algebra map** from my type-`A` presentation onto theirs, sending\ngenerator to generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_braid'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_braid'","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L89-L117","doc":"Their `σ` satisfies my single `altProd` braid family, which packages their separate\nbraid and commutation relations plus the trivial diagonal case. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_quadratic'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_quadratic'","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L73-L86","doc":"Their `σ` satisfies the quadratic relation in my `(T − q)(T + 1) = 0` shape.\nTheirs is stated as `σ² = (q−1)·σ + q·1`; the two are the same identity rearranged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_far","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_far","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L64-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_adjacent'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_adjacent'","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L59-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_adjacent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_adjacent","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L54-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.strandMatrix_self","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeTypeAPresentationEquiv.lean#L51-L52","signatureChunk":0}]}